        <mxCell id="lg_note" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;b&gt;Edge label format:&lt;/b&gt; first line = data format (CSV, Parquet, Feature Store records, or metadata); following line = IAM identity performing the read or write. Every write after the initial upload runs as &lt;b&gt;northstar-dev-DataEngineer&lt;/b&gt;: it writes raw/, processed/ and features/ but cannot write artifacts/. &lt;b&gt;MLEngineer&lt;/b&gt; only reads on this path (Lab 3+) and cannot write raw/ or processed/. Grain changes once: transaction-level through processed/, then one labeled row per customer in features/. Features come from the observation window (≤ 2026-04-01); churn_label comes only from the outcome window (2026-04-01, 2026-06-30]." vertex="1">
